	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"For &eCreate&r, the design of this modpack is as follows:"
				""
				"&31. Discover that certain items require Create machinery to craft&r"
				"&3↓&r"
				"&32. Use JEI to look up the required Create components, and craft them step by step&r"
				"&3↓&r"
				"&33. For any mechanical contraptions, always “press W to think” carefully&r"
				""
				"As long as you follow this approach, the Create content in this modpack will be more than sufficient to enjoy. &4(Full automation is not required to complete or enjoy the modpack.)&r"
				""
				"&cFor all Create's contraptions, always remember to “Hold [W] to ponder”！！&r"
				"&cFor all Create's contraptions, always remember to “Hold [W] to ponder”！！&r"
				"&cFor all Create's contraptions, always remember to “Hold [W] to ponder”！！&r"
