			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1112F6121BC5A1E5"]
			description: [
				"Whether it is pressing or mixing, manual operation is inevitably tedious."
				""
				"Therefore, we turn to automation, freeing our hands and immersive in the romance of industrialization."
				""
				"Use a &6Shaft&r to power &6Conveyor Belts&r, setting them into motion."
				""
				"Thus, the &2assembly line factory&r of Create is born."
