			dependencies: ["0FC81607771D0F71"]
			description: [
				"To further progress in Create, you will need some basic machines used to produce materials commonly required in various recipes."
				""
				"One of the most important is the &5Mechanical Press&r, which is used for various &6pressing&r operations, such as producing iron sheets. This process must be performed on either a &6conveyor belt&r or a &6depot&r."
