			description: [
				"The &6Mechanical Crafter&r allows crafting recipes larger than 4×4. Some machines (such as the Crushing Wheel) specifically require it to be assembled using a Mechanical Crafter."
				""
				"When powering the Mechanical Crafter, you must pay attention to the order in which items are arranged, as this affects its efficiency. If a recipe contains empty slots, a &6Crafting Slot Cover&r must be used as a placeholder."
