			dependencies: ["10A1552945CF569F"]
			description: [
				"The &9Mechanical Plough&r can clear non-solid, non-collidable entities (such as torches). It can also function as a harvester, beside that it can gently push entities away without causing damage."
				""
				"The &9Mechanical Drill&r is used for mining blocks, functioning the same way as a player’s manual mining."
				""
