		{
			dependencies: ["0677F6E36035E869"]
			description: [
				"The &6Encased Fan&r can be combined with &cLava&r for smelting, with &9Water&r for washing, with a&e Campfire&r for smoking food, and with a &bSoul Campfire&r to infuse items with souls."
				""
				"In practical production setups, conveyor belts are often used for washing and smelting processes. It is important to note that &2higher rotational speed only increases the blowing range&r, but does not accelerate the processing speed itself. Only when &2multiple Encased Fan operate on the same item simultaneously&r, the efficiency can be stacked."
