			description: [
				"By using a combination of &6Small Cogwheels + Large Cogwheels&r, you can &2decrease or increase&r rotational speed. You can learn the specific placement method by pressing &2W (ponder) on the cogwheel&r."
				""
				"This is the most commonly used method of speed conversion in the early game. Note that if there is a mismatch between rotational speeds, the gears will break！"
				""
				"Once Brass is obtained, you can instead use a &6Rotation Speed Controller&r to freely adjust rotational speed, which becomes one of your main mid-to-late game goals."
