		{
			dependencies: ["0FC81607771D0F71"]
			description: [
				"The &6Mechanical Mixer&r requires at least &530 RPM (rotations per minute)&r to operate properly. This means you will need at least one set of &2large and small cogwheel gearing&r to achieve the required speed."
				""
				"In addition, most mixing recipes require a &6Basin&r to hold the ingredients. Some recipes may also require heating, which means you will need to place a &6Blaze Burner&r beneath the Basin and supply it with the appropriate fuel."
				""
				"Of course, you may not be able to craft the Blaze Burner yet, but in the course of your journey, it will become almost inevitable."
